  "question": {
    "text": "' x ' g of NaCl is added to water in a beaker with a lid. The temperature of the system is raised from $1^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ to $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$. Which out of the following plots, is best suited for the change in the molarity (M) of the solution with respect to temperature?<br />[Consider the solubility of NaCl remains unchanged over the temperature range]",
    "image": null
  },
